description:
Critical security fix - SQL injection vulnerability:

## Current Vulnerable Code
```csharp
if (_entityId.HasValue)
    whereClause += $" AND entity_id = '{_entityId.Value}'";
```

## Required Fix
```csharp
if (_entityId.HasValue)
{
    whereClause += " AND entity_id = @entityId";
    parameters.Add("entityId", _entityId.Value);
}
```

## Audit Required
- Check ALL string interpolation in query code
- Ensure NO raw SQL uses user input directly
- All parameters must use parameterized queries

This is P0 - must be fixed regardless of other work.
